<title>USA: Chief Consolidated Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Chief Consolidated Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended March 31:		 1997		   1996*</p>
<p> Revenue				   $16,518		$40,839</p>
<p> Loss					209,293		460,089</p>
<p> Net Loss				  209,293		460,089</p>
<p>Shr. Earns:</p>
<p> Loss					  (.03)		  (.08)</p>
<p> Net Loss				    (.03)		  (.08)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company also reported results for fiscal years ended December 31, 1996 and 1995. Year results are provided below.</p>
<p>  Fiscal Year Ended December 31:   1996		     1995*</p>
<p> Revenue				116,010		   290,471</p>
<p> Loss				 1,518,093		 1,294,594</p>
<p> Net Loss			   1,518,093		 1,294,594</p>
<p>Shr. Earns:</p>
<p> Loss				    $(.26)		    $(.25)</p>
<p> Net Loss				 (.26)		     (.25)</p>
<p>NOTE: * Restated to reflect consolidation with South Standard Mining Company acquired on June 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is Chief Consolidated Mining Co.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
